=== p1. the minimum sufficient accumulator width, second instrument ===

  reference : the exact ambient sum, adapted once onto the format
  candidate : eager adaptation into width A at every step, adapted once at the end
  exact     : the width holding every exact sum, derived from the interval
  measured  : the smallest A at which candidate and reference agree everywhere
  gap       : exact - measured

  Every cell is exhaustive over every tuple. Nothing here is sampled, and a
  cell above the budget is listed as unreached rather than estimated.
  tuple budget per cell: 40000000

